/-! Holomorphic block `222-0`: exact positivity of its face block `A = Kᵀ N K`
(1 x 1). `C` is an approximate Cholesky factor of `A` at scale `t = 2^1`; the kernel checks
`C Cᵀ = CC` and that `t² A - CC` is symmetric and row dominant. -/

open scoped Matrix ComplexOrder

set_option maxRecDepth 100000
set_option maxHeartbeats 0

namespace ThreeCopyQutritWerner.X2HBlockPsdH0x222k0Face

def A : Matrix (Fin 1) (Fin 1) ℤ :=
  !![3422555925826361066344069202421894371176227830735456797409280000]

def C : Matrix (Fin 1) (Fin 1) ℤ :=
  !![101329501022550600533025806684203]

